# Normalize line endings: store LF in the repo and check out LF on every
# platform. Stops the recurring "LF will be replaced by CRLF" warnings and the
# phantom whole-file diffs that show up on Windows checkouts — one 33-line edit
# to lib/settings.js once rendered as an 893-line diff for exactly this reason.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Common binary assets — never normalize these.
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.gif   binary
*.ico   binary
*.webp  binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf   binary
*.eot   binary
*.otf   binary
*.pdf   binary
